1674:          <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>観点</th><th>現行（pf-api）</th><th>移行先（ec-cube-enterprise）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>カード詳細マスタのテーブル</td><td><code>mtb_card_detail</code></td><td><code>mtb_card_detail</code>（同一スキーマ）</td></tr><tr><td>主な列</td><td><code>card_id</code>・<code>back_card_detail_id</code>・<code>cardset_id</code>・<code>rarity_id</code>・<code>illustrator_id</code>・<code>flavor_jp</code>・<code>flavor_en</code>・<code>text_jp</code>・<code>text_en</code>・<code>power</code>・<code>toughness</code>・<code>card_no</code>・<code>foil_flg</code>・<code>promotion_flg</code>・<code>create_date</code>・<code>update_date</code></td><td>同一の列名（差分なし）</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
